{"path":"/zh/patterns/r1-chain-of-thought/cases/liangbo/","title":"R1 · 思维链 · 东方屹腾执行型 Agent","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-6222a80fc54694eb-1","revision":"6222a80fc54694ebeed043d184c41052846bbbb92101bcdd7beb1589aa84aba3","tag":"p","quote":"模式矩阵/R1 思维链/蓝皮书"},{"block_id":"adps-984f2ebcee26e6a8-1","revision":"984f2ebcee26e6a8e18807b9bf244bf922066f812c70a20e61ca865adb613ffb","tag":"table","quote":"字段 值 主模式 R1 思维链 Chain-of-Thought（推理 × 链式） 结合模式 R2 复杂度路由 · A1 工具调度 案例 上海东方屹腾科技 · HR/薪酬 SaaS · 服务 2 万+ 企业 · 执行型 Agent 对应白皮书 /zh/patterns/r1-chain-of-thought/ 源 梁博 AICon 逐字稿第三章 · PPT 第 13 页 工程结论 每轮推理读取 ReasonContext，输出供后续使用的叙事结论和一个可执行的下一步控制信号。"},{"block_id":"adps-446903833f7f67eb-1","revision":"446903833f7f67eb0369ebe296888e32a4438def0f00d92c9a61c1a19b69ffed","tag":"p","quote":"意图网关返回 resolve，只说明用户请求需要执行。系统还要判断下一步是检索知识、调用 Skill、进入任务规划、继续推理还是结束。这个判断必须映射到程序已经注册的动作。"},{"block_id":"adps-563dc3cd118091ba-1","revision":"563dc3cd118091ba4ad33e5dfc8a0528885fc2172e17de468e6e1ae0a53b7d9c","tag":"p","quote":"固定一次分类调用适合意图识别，无法覆盖会随工具回执变化的事务流程。东方屹腾使用链式推理逐轮处理最新上下文，并设置最大步数和退出信号。"},{"block_id":"adps-4347b4c1975bc089-1","revision":"4347b4c1975bc0894b34116410e8b0d59a32e7c590a43404bc78656c910f22b0","tag":"p","quote":"推理输入由 ReasonContext 组装，包含："},{"block_id":"adps-57f8516c924ade6f-1","revision":"57f8516c924ade6f929332e7805a496b1cf989c10afb3b6d29b84a7056db3a21","tag":"li","quote":"当前允许选择的动作类型。"},{"block_id":"adps-2aef4c9667406ec0-1","revision":"2aef4c9667406ec0d1897d935268ac8e664e796380d5277fa579736ac1920794","tag":"p","quote":"ReasonContext 从少量字段逐步扩展，字段由真实调用需要决定。机械参数和任务调度状态保持在各自状态平面，不以自然语言复制值。"},{"block_id":"adps-92cfc15a216ca737-1","revision":"92cfc15a216ca73769868c9b871d71b3db6a1d8a04adaacd12ca04743425851c","tag":"li","quote":"叙事结论：对当前输入的分析摘要，写入叙事状态，供规划、行动和最终回复使用；"},{"block_id":"adps-2c539628efd68f58-1","revision":"2c539628efd68f58d17f14dbc93fd3f103d5c5308e13993aa496cebf8191c019","tag":"li","quote":"控制信号：结构化的下一步动作，交给 Orchestrator。"},{"block_id":"adps-b9535c8282bd139c-1","revision":"b9535c8282bd139ca8206a85c5c51078f8fbd12fc09bbe911b441cfadb80c130","tag":"pre","quote":"{ \"analysis_summary\": \"已确认需要从模板库匹配薪资组\", \"next_action\": \"retrieve_skill\", \"target\": \"salary_group_template\", \"done\": false }"},{"block_id":"adps-f01ac5d0bed91a3e-1","revision":"f01ac5d0bed91a3ef6c24d2af70b957cb0d8279d5c44c4fcdaba2a756b180ee1","tag":"p","quote":"有些模型接口支持独立的 reasoning summary 或分析字段；系统只存接口明确返回且允许使用的内容，不依赖模型隐藏推理过程。"},{"block_id":"adps-6f2ff3d927ab4074-1","revision":"6f2ff3d927ab4074594ed7770a920ef1105bd924ad7b9ae32dd1398b01b00056","tag":"p","quote":"链式推理每轮只决定下一步。工具执行会改变业务状态，后续动作应根据真实回执重新评估。任务结构已经明确时，控制信号可以转入规划执行，由 DAG 维护完整步骤；结构不明确时继续单步推理或 ReAct。"},{"block_id":"adps-798a2caa316114f4-1","revision":"798a2caa316114f4837baea97ba066870a291bd3adf9abeee3f9c626f500f841","tag":"p","quote":"控制信号必须映射到有限动作集合，例如："},{"block_id":"adps-b82ce554b5d834ef-1","revision":"b82ce554b5d834ef3160a2fb9810b3e7d6fc0e16ac8c266c68806c1fe866079f","tag":"pre","quote":"retrieve_knowledge retrieve_skill invoke_action plan_tasks continue_reasoning finish escalate"},{"block_id":"adps-6726eaae3d101241-1","revision":"6726eaae3d101241eee293f735b1bb88e0ec713eb96fea79b90cc050e3dbec4e","tag":"p","quote":"未知动作、Schema 解析失败或达到步数上限时进入确定的兜底分支。"},{"block_id":"adps-b5db492d5174bba8-1","revision":"b5db492d5174bba8f04608667a42cab49de80061e91314da01469edf38198378","tag":"p","quote":"薪资组请求进入 resolve 后，首轮推理可能输出 retrieve_skill。Skill 和相关经验加入 ReasonContext 后，下一轮决定匹配模板；收到工具回执后，再判断任务依赖是否已明确并转入规划执行。"},{"block_id":"adps-0ce7bfade627b69f-1","revision":"0ce7bfade627b69f6402b1514d9212ebc189cabf4044d60b510e29a241618a08","tag":"p","quote":"每次模型调用的输入引用、输出摘要、控制信号、模型版本和成本进入 Activity/Frame 时间线。"},{"block_id":"adps-5a5c20358fb126a6-1","revision":"5a5c20358fb126a600d6702d4543eb252a9659012fa7a96ffd4c24d963750bb4","tag":"li","quote":"输出只有自然语言，没有程序可消费的动作；"},{"block_id":"adps-936116dfd13af534-1","revision":"936116dfd13af5348305ba13a1e6e5cbefb60bd9db267afdf21ba46dfd58fdea","tag":"li","quote":"next_action 可以自由生成，无法映射到注册能力；"},{"block_id":"adps-e533e58b81ddf3cc-1","revision":"e533e58b81ddf3ccf87ed78b91ad3b3b99f0705d55686961291e9368d6145ae6","tag":"li","quote":"一次生成全部步骤，却不根据工具回执更新；"},{"block_id":"adps-2c9810b92153f2d9-1","revision":"2c9810b92153f2d9cffd1f7008efc5eea85823ce869b7609a07582479b1f2a5d","tag":"li","quote":"ReasonContext 持续累积所有历史；"},{"block_id":"adps-b8ad2e6fe5596573-1","revision":"b8ad2e6fe559657320c1e04e8166d2a4ca73b2b9f0d1d5214bbab21160a0c8fe","tag":"li","quote":"解析失败后无限重试或随机选择动作；"},{"block_id":"adps-7e48f265e6379280-1","revision":"7e48f265e6379280d0b280b6ff6b5229095ca57e726debae12f38e7a5a2c59fe","tag":"li","quote":"系统依赖不可访问的隐藏推理内容。"},{"block_id":"adps-7083627b483bf37f-1","revision":"7083627b483bf37f8fc487e567d7a7737e766033dfc8ab65b27c5bde2e6d39c4","tag":"li","quote":"控制信号 Schema 解析成功率；"},{"block_id":"adps-0df290cf9d8491ab-1","revision":"0df290cf9d8491abc88dea9bbcd999b10671485196c319ef4e774f4ee3bce7ba","tag":"li","quote":"信号到注册动作的映射成功率；"},{"block_id":"adps-ab84190c4244eaf3-1","revision":"ab84190c4244eaf3904808fe315476a7339a479ab74dbb0ae0141ff3f6e06d43","tag":"li","quote":"平均推理步数和步数上限触发率；"},{"block_id":"adps-3e0d8bd2b71eb787-1","revision":"3e0d8bd2b71eb7875961004c25cdc8337bb7f1c11be82d2bea68d8a5fa9c1b73","tag":"li","quote":"因过早规划导致的 replan 次数；"},{"block_id":"adps-805e98b0c0061d2d-1","revision":"805e98b0c0061d2dad4095cc54c0e24c76bde946c17695d047f174f9d618f761","tag":"li","quote":"叙事结论到后续决策的引用完整率；"},{"block_id":"adps-c6aeaba61c32bc5e-1","revision":"c6aeaba61c32bc5e95b70e68498c5376e5586cba01995b390387e3809ee27cd4","tag":"li","quote":"解析失败后的安全退出率。"},{"block_id":"adps-8eaf468e3a00ece9-1","revision":"8eaf468e3a00ece9ab57bc9130cb98547344f90e371874575ca18e2466b2b1e2","tag":"p","quote":"R1 白皮书强调推理输出必须进入工程控制流。东方屹腾将叙事结论和结构化动作分离，并由 Orchestrator 消费下一步信号。JSON 解析失败使用预定义回退，不把格式异常传播到行动模块。"},{"block_id":"adps-c047cdd339926acb-1","revision":"c047cdd339926acb3ebe08f88924c808cc1ceef928f870c3dad6a53d7277b504","tag":"p","quote":"当任务由多次状态变化驱动、下一步必须根据最新回执决定时，适合使用这种链式推理。一次即可完成的内容生成任务不需要为每轮增加控制信号和 ReasonContext。"},{"block_id":"adps-a9fff244b2dad947-1","revision":"a9fff244b2dad9476799f90902f3113a69f2bef129f75bd96497a77a5b0f078d","tag":"p","quote":"引用建议：ADPS、梁博，《东方屹腾 · 思维链》，企业 Agent 系统蓝皮书 v0.4，2026-08-02。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-79480e7125ad6903-1","revision":"79480e7125ad690354825fcdaaf560618dbc0f310b5df40f3f9e4ed205348fd8","tag":"p","quote":"证据边界：本页是完整案例的模式切片，记录特定系统约束下的实现选择。案例方提供的实现与效果信息未经过独立审计，不构成通用性能承诺。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
